{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "05d5389f-976c-8db9-89fb-46cef32f9e7d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:08:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Margaret Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:06:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:06:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Greg, good morning. Um, I'm on speakerphone, I've got my hands full, so can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:06:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I'm putting a deck on the back, a second-story one, off the upstairs kitchen. And I don't totally get what I need. Somebody said a deck's a deck, but somebody else said it's different if it's up high. Do I need a permit for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:07:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A deck that high, yes, you're going to need a deck permit. Ground-level little platforms are one thing, but second story, that goes through us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:07:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, the railing. How high does the railing have to be? I thought it was like thirty inches, but my brother-in-law said forty-two. [line breaks up] ...one of us is wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:07:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out on me. You said thirty versus forty-two?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:07:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, thirty or forty-two. Which is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:07:34-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a deck that far off the ground, you're looking at the taller one. Thirty is more like a stair or a low guard thing. The inspector will go over the exact requirements when you file, but plan on the higher number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:07:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Forty-two. Okay. Wait, so is that from the floor of the deck or from the ground? I always mix that up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:07:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "From the deck surface, the walking surface up to the top of the rail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:07:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay, so not from the ground. Good, that makes more sense. Sorry, I'm a renter, so I'm doing this for my landlord, and I don't really know the process. What do I bring in? Like what documents?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:08:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bring the application, a drawing or plan of the deck with the measurements, and where it sits on the lot. And since you're a renter, the owner's going to have to sign off on it. Contractor info too if you're hiring one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:08:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, the owner signs, not me? Even if I'm the one paying for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:08:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, it's their property. They sign the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:08:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Okay. I'm picking up extra weekend hours at work to pay for it, honestly, so we can still do the family trip this spring. So I want to get it right the first time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:08:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Come by the office with the plan and the owner's signature and we'll walk you through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:08:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So drawing, application, owner signs. And forty-two inches. I think I've got it. Thanks, Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Any time. Take care."
    }
  ],
